      "evidence": ["src/wrappers/x86_64-linux-gnu-cxx11.jl:4-23", "src/HiGHS_jll.jl:2-9"]
    },
    {
      "name": "跨平台二进制适配",
      "description": "为 16 个平台-架构组合（aarch64/x86_64/armv6l/armv7l/i686 × macOS/Linux/Windows/FreeBSD × glibc/musl）各生成一份平台专用的 wrapper 脚本，处理路径、库名后缀等差异",
      "evidence": ["src/wrappers/", "README.md:27-42"]
    }
  ],
